      <title>AI重构文旅：从“性价比”到“心价比”，智能生态开启深度体验时代</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20250916111004805-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 11:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
